<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>All but one Helibor interest</p>
<p>rates were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Tuesday. The three-month fell one basis point to 3.05 percent.</p>
<p>			February 24 fix    February 24 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.05 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.15 pct		3.15 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.23 pct		3.23 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.32 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
